{"t":"MS","made":"2026-11-19 01:25","name":"Morgan Stanley","ko":"모건스탠리","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Capital Markets","employees":84000,"hq":"New York, NY, United States","website":"https://www.morganstanley.com","summary_en":"Morgan Stanley, a financial holding company, provides various financial products and services to corporations, governments, financial institutions, and individuals in the Americas, Asia, Europe, the Middle East, and Africa. It operates through Institutional Securities, Wealth Management, and Investment Management segments. The company offers capital raising and financial advisory services, including services related to the underwriting of debt, equity securities, and other products, as well as advice on mergers and acquisitions, restructurings, and project finance. It also provides equity and fixed income products comprising sales, financing, prime brokerage, and market-making services; Asia wealth management; business-related investments services; originating corporate and commercial real estate loans, secured lending facilities, and extending securities-based and other financing; and research activities. In addition, the company offers financial advisor-led brokerage, investment advisory, custody, cash management, and administrative services; self-directed brokerage services; financial and wealth planning services; stock plan administration; securities-based lending, residential real estate loans, and other lending products; banking; and retirement plan services. Further, it provides equity, fixed income, alternatives and solutions, and liquidity and overlay services to benefit/defined contribution plans, foundations, endowments, government entities, sovereign wealth funds, insurance companies, third-party fund sponsors, corporations, and individuals. Morgan Stanley was founded in 1924 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"금융지주회사인 모건스탠리는 미주, 아시아, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카 지역의 기업, 정부, 금융기관, 개인에게 다양한 금융상품과 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 기관 증권, 자산 관리 및 투자 관리 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 회사는 부채, 지분증권 및 기타 상품의 인수와 관련된 서비스뿐만 아니라 인수합병, 구조조정, 프로젝트 파이낸싱에 대한 조언을 포함하여 자본 조달 및 금융 자문 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 판매, 금융, 프라임 브로커리지, 시장조성 서비스로 구성된 주식 및 채권 상품을 제공합니다. 아시아자산관리; 비즈니스 관련 투자 서비스; 기업 및 상업용 부동산 대출, 담보 대출 시설, 증권 기반 및 기타 금융 확장 및 연구 활동. 또한 회사는 금융 자문가 주도의 중개, 투자 자문, 보관, 현금 관리 및 행정 서비스를 제공합니다. 자기주도형 중개 서비스; 금융 및 자산 계획 서비스; 재고 계획 관리; 증권 기반 대출, 주거용 부동산 대출 및 기타 대출 상품; 은행업; 및 은퇴 계획 서비스. 또한 혜택/확정 기여 계획, 재단, 기부금, 정부 기관, 국부 펀드, 보험 회사, 제3자 펀드 스폰서, 기업 및 개인에게 주식, 채권, 대안 및 솔루션, 유동성 및 오버레이 서비스를 제공합니다. Morgan Stanley는 1924년에 설립되었으며 뉴욕주 뉴욕에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":180.695,"mcap":282434207744.0,"pe":14.329501,"fpe":13.2182455,"peg":1.5966,"ps":3.5395417,"pb":2.6343834,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":2.51,"beta":1.22,"hi52":232.25,"lo52":152.8},"fin":{"rev":79794003968.0,"rev_g":0.108,"eps_g":0.082,"gross":0.87307,"op":0.40196,"net":0.25634,"roe":0.18035,"fcf":null,"cash":767412011008.0,"debt":579486023680.0,"de":489.762,"eps":12.61,"feps":13.67012},"own":{"short":0.0,"inst":0.62590003,"insider":0.24236},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":211.5,"median":206.5,"high":262.0,"low":185.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.30769,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":9,"hold":14,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":9,"hold":14,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":9,"hold":13,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":2,"buy":9,"hold":12,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":240.0,"priorPriceTarget":236.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-19","Firm":"BMO Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":210.0,"priorPriceTarget":215.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-16","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raise